---
import GridOverlay from './GridOverlay.astro';
---
<section id="como-funciona" class="relative py-24 bg-skylight/30">
  <GridOverlay />
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 relative">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center fade-in opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-700">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-navy">
        KeepData convierte documentos desordenados en información útil.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-graytext text-lg">
        La propuesta busca automatizar el procesamiento de facturas utilizando inteligencia artificial.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-20 relative">
      <!-- Línea horizontal conectora (solo desktop) -->
      <div class="hidden md:block absolute top-6 left-[16.66%] right-[16.66%] h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand/20 via-brand to-brand/20"></div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 md:gap-8">
        <div class="relative text-center fade-in opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-700">
          <div class="relative z-10 w-12 h-12 mx-auto rounded-full bg-brand text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shadow-lg shadow-brand/30">
            01
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 font-bold text-navy text-xl">Recibe</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-graytext text-sm max-w-[220px] mx-auto">Carga o recibe tus facturas en diferentes formatos.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative text-center fade-in opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-700">
          <div class="relative z-10 w-12 h-12 mx-auto rounded-full bg-brand text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shadow-lg shadow-brand/30">
            02
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 font-bold text-navy text-xl">Extrae</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-graytext text-sm max-w-[220px] mx-auto">La inteligencia artificial identifica y extrae la información relevante.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative text-center fade-in opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-700">
          <div class="relative z-10 w-12 h-12 mx-auto rounded-full bg-brand text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shadow-lg shadow-brand/30">
            03
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 font-bold text-navy text-xl">Organiza</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-graytext text-sm max-w-[220px] mx-auto">Revisa la información y prepárala para utilizarla o exportarla.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>